mode: "100644"
text: "# The MAGNET framework — design the magnet AND the funnel\n\nA lead magnet is the first touch in a relationship, not a destination — and the magnet alone is half the\njob. MAGNET designs both: a specific, instant-value magnet tied to your offer, wrapped in a whole\nsocial→capture→nurture funnel. The agent designs + drafts; **WoopSocial has no landing/form/email/quiz\nbuilder** — it publishes the **promo posts**; capture/delivery/nurture run in **external tools**.\n\n## M — Match to one audience + one problem\n- **One audience, one problem, one quick win.** Pull the pain from `brand-profile`/audience research; the\n  goal from `goals-and-kpis`. Broad = converts no one.\n\n## A — Anchor to the paid offer + the stage\n- The magnet **solves one piece** of the larger puzzle the **paid offer** completes (so it qualifies). **Match\n  to stage:** top = quiz/calculator; mid = template/benchmark; bottom = case study/ROI calculator.\n\n## G — Give an instant, interactive result\n- Prefer **interactive/instant-result** formats (quiz, calculator, assessment, generator, specific template)\n  — ~4× a static PDF; **an on-the-spot result beats \"check your inbox.\"** Quick to consume, immediately usable.\n\n## N — Name it for the outcome\n- **Specific, outcome-focused title** (\"The Pricing Calculator: see what to charge in 60s\"), not \"The\n  Ultimate Guide to X.\"\n\n## E — Engineer the whole funnel\n- **benefit-first landing → short form (email / +first name only) → instant success page → delivery email\n  → 3–5 email nurture.** Each extra form field −5–10%; on-page video helps (directional — A/B it). Map the\n  path before building.\n\n## T — Tend the nurture (value-first, behavior-branched)\n- **Deliver → quick win → proof → soft next step.** **Branch on behavior** (opens/clicks/visits), not just\n  drip. Don't pitch early. Measure signups/clicks/conversions from the external tools + GA4 — **never fabricate.**\n\n## The funnel brief a request should fill\n```\nAUDIENCE + PROBLEM: one reader, one pain, one quick win (tied to a KPI)\nMAGNET: stage-matched format + instant result; connects to the paid offer; outcome-focused title\nFUNNEL: landing (benefit-first) -> short form -> success page -> delivery email -> 3-5 nurture\nNURTURE: deliver -> quick win -> proof -> soft next step; branch on behavior\nPROMO: the social posts that drive signups (WoopSocial publishes); capture path = link-in-bio / DM\nTOOLS + METRICS: external builder/ESP (human-set-up); signups/conversions from those + GA4 (never fabricated)\n```\n"
